  description: "Your opponent cannot Tribute this face-up card on the field, and
    cannot target it with card effects. You can only use each of these effects of
    \"Darkest Diabolos, Lord of the Lair\" once per turn.\n\u25CF If a DARK monster
    you control is Tributed (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon
    this card from your GY (if it was there when you Tributed) or hand (even if not).\n\u25CF
    You can Tribute 1 DARK monster; your opponent places 1 card from their hand on
    either the top or bottom of the Deck."
